# ::tok Tourism Minister Yoel Razvazov, who in recent weeks has supported easing restrictions on the entry of foreign tourists to Israel, said yesterday: "The cancellation of the quarantine for those who return from abroad and the return of tourism to those who are vaccinated are the right and right thing at this time.
